01:51:37.410 --> 01:51:49.240
<i>本当のさよならを知らなかったあの時</i>

01:51:37.410 --> 01:51:49.240
<i>Back then, I didn't know what it really meant to say goodbye</i>

01:51:50.050 --> 01:52:01.290
<i>Kowareyuku kokoro wa zutto kimi o sagashiteta</i>

01:51:50.050 --> 01:52:01.290
<i>壊れ行く心はずっと君を探してた</i>

01:51:50.050 --> 01:52:01.290
<i>My breaking heart was always searching for you</i>

01:52:02.000 --> 01:52:07.840
<i>Moshimo todoku no naraba</i>

01:52:02.000 --> 01:52:07.840
<i>もしも届くのならば</i>

01:52:02.000 --> 01:52:07.840
<i>If I could have reached you,</i>

01:52:07.840 --> 01:52:14.380
<i>tsutaetakatta koto ga takusan aru</i>

01:52:07.840 --> 01:52:14.380
<i>伝えたかったことがたくさんある</i>

01:52:07.840 --> 01:52:14.380
<i>there's so much I've wanted to tell you</i>

01:52:14.380 --> 01:52:21.360
<i>Subete no kimochi de kimi no egao o</i>

01:52:14.380 --> 01:52:21.360
<i>全ての気持ちで君の笑顔を</i>

01:52:14.380 --> 01:52:21.360
<i>I vow, with all of my feelings,</i>

01:52:21.360 --> 01:52:27.860
<i>tayasazu soba ni itai to chikau yo</i>

01:52:21.360 --> 01:52:27.860
<i>絶やさず 側にいたいと誓うよ</i>

01:52:21.360 --> 01:52:27.860
<i>to wish your smile would never fade from beside me</i>

